          "value": "<p><strong>Special </strong>This action can only be taken at the port and starboard control mechanisms.</p><p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per ten minutes; <strong>Effect</strong> A crew member must use this activity on their turn to prepare the electrical components at one of the Jolt Gun control stations, and then a second crew member can use this ability again within a round at the other Jolt Gun control station to unleash a huge electrical blast, dealing @Damage[10d12[electricity]] damage to all creatures within 15 feet of the shark diver. Crew and passengers of the shark diver are unaffected. Affected creatures must attempt a @Check[reflex|dc:34|basic] save.<br /></p>"
