        "description": {
          "gm": "",
          "value": "<p>Melee (1a) Jaws [[/r 1d20+28]] (reach 15 feet, grapple) @Damage[(3d12+17)[piercing]]</p><p>Athletics [[/r 1d20+28]]</p><p>The shark diver's Jaws can only hit enemies in a 180 degree arc in the same direction as the vehicle's heading.</p><p><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\">A crew member may Strike using the Shark Diver's jaws attack - this counts as a simple weapon melee strike for the crew member for any abilities they may have (ie ranger Precision damage, Power Attack, Reactive Strike, etc)</span></p>"
