          "value": "<p>Melee (1a) Tail [[/r 1d20+28]] (reach 25 feet, shove) Damage @Damage[(3d10+14)[bludgeoning]] plus @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.bestiary-ability-glossary-srd.Item.t6cx9FOODmeZQNYl]{Push} 15 feet</p><p>Athletics [[/r 1d20+28]]</p><p>The shark diver's Tail can only hit enemies in a 180 degree radius behind its heading.</p><p>A crew member may Strike using the Shark Diver's tail attack - this counts as a simple weapon melee strike for the crew member for any abilities they may have (ie ranger Precision damage, Power Attack, etc)</p>"
