        "actionType": {
          "value": "passive"
        },
        "actions": {
          "value": null
        },
        "category": null,
        "deathNote": false,
        "description": {
          "gm": "",
          "value": "<p>There are four control mechanisms located in each quadrant of the Shark Diver. The Jaws, Port Guns, Starboard Guns, and the Tail. There is space for two PCs at each control mechanism, and a PC must be adjacent to a control mechanism to use it. Abilities used at a control mechanism can only affect targets in a 180 degree hemisphere around that mechanism's side of the shark. IE, the Jaws attack can only target enemies in reach in a 180 degree arc in the direction of the shark's current heading.</p><p>Strikes made from the control mechanisms count as either melee (Jaws/Tail) or ranged (Jolt Gun) simple weapon Strikes for the purposes of any abilities the player using it may have, such as the Precision ranger edge, Sneak Attack, Reactive Strike, Power Attack, etc. </p><p>The control mechanisms can transmit spells and any other auditory effects (Demoralize, Bon Mot) to the outside. A PC must be adjacent to a control mechanism to use this effect, and can only target creatures in a 180 arc around whatever side of the shark their mechanism is, at whatever the range of their spell or ability is.</p>"
        },
