        "description": {
          "gm": "",
          "value": "<p>Ranged (1a) Jolt Gun [[/r 1d20+28]] (range 90 feet) @Damage[(3d6+14)[electricity]]</p><p>There are two electrical jolt firing mechanisms on the shark diver - one on the port side, and one on the starboard side. Each firing mechanism can only fire at enemies in a 180 degree angle from its side.</p><p>A crew member may Strike using the Shark Diver's electrical jolt attack - this counts as a simple weapon ranged strike for the crew member for any abilities they may have (ie ranger precision damage, sneak attack, etc).</p>"
