          "value": "<p><strong>Requirements</strong> You are at the piloting/jaws control mechanism. The Sharp Turn action must have been taken.</p><p>Attempt a piloting check, with the following effects. If the Shields! ability is active, half all the angles. </p><p><strong>Critical Success</strong> You can spin the shark's heading up to 180 degrees.</p><p><strong>Success </strong>You can spin the shark's heading up to 90 degrees.</p><p><strong>Failure </strong>You can spin the shark's heading up to 90 degrees, but you either over or undershoot by up to 45 degrees.</p><p><strong>Critical Failure </strong>The shark spins to a random angle and becomes <em>uncontrolled.</em></p>"
