        "category": null,
        "deathNote": false,
        "description": {
          "gm": "",
          "value": "<p><strong>Frequency </strong>Once per round</p><p>A crew member at any control station can activate the Shark Diver's self repair function. Attempt a Piloting check with the following effects:</p><p><strong>Critical Success </strong>You restore [[/r 50]] HP to the Shark Diver.</p><p><strong>Success </strong>You restore [[/r 25]] HP to the Shark Diver.</p><p>Out of combat, you can use this action as a 10 minute exploration activity to automatically restore the shark diver to full HP without the need for a check.</p>"
        },
