        "category": null,
        "deathNote": false,
        "description": {
          "gm": "",
          "value": "<p>The Dungeoneering Society's best have designed this vehicle to be especially easy to patch up from the inside. If you have the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.Item.ASy9AKEIRxPYUi5o]{Quick Repair} feat, you count as one proficiency rank higher when you use it on the Shark Diver. If you're already Legendary in crafting, you restore an additional 5 hit points, or 10 hit points on a critical success to Repair. The DC to Repair the Shark Diver is equal to its Piloting DC.</p>"
